# An attribute, which is found through φ.
#
#   ⟦ a ↦ ⟦ φ ↦ ⟦ b ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A ⟧ ⟧ ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.a.b ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.167.

F c0 a foo
F c1 φ
F c2 b
F c3
Δ c3 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A
P c2 b c3
P c1 φ c2
P c0 a c1
D c4 c0 a
D c5 c4 b
P c0 foo c5
